      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Hateful",
      "description": "The meme explicitly uses antisemitic stereotypes by mapping the innocent Muppet character Ernie to the violent metaphor of being 'locked in his oven,' which is historically associated with the Holocaust and dehumanizes Jewish people. This is a direct attack on a protected group based on ethnicity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
